- [Mastra `createScorer` リファレンス](https://mastra.ai/reference/evals/create-scorer)
- [Mastra `runEvals` リファレンス](https://mastra.ai/reference/evals/run-evals)
- [Mastraデータセットの概要](https://mastra.ai/docs/evals/datasets/overview)
